  m_text: 'Thank you for playing Illusio Fracta! This game first and foremost is
    a puzzle game.


    You''ll be able to command your character to perform various
    actions, but sometimes what you''d *like* to do may not always be a valid option.
    I''d recommend interacting with the content in the game as directly as you can
    -- being vague usually won''t help you progress.


    If you ever feel like
    you''re stuck, you can always input "help" to get a small sample of helpful words
    for the area that you''re in. There *will* always be a path forward, you just
    have to find it!'
